<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43663" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐδιεινός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔδιος, χειμών</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				3.12
			</span></i> (v.l.), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>in Arat.</u>
				7
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαλήνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					919a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροπαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					542b5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ζέφυρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					943b21
				</span></i>
			, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν εὐδιεινοῖς</span> in
				<i>sheltered spots</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				5.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				548b21
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Mete.</u>
				347a23
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.2.5
			</span></i>. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῶς</span>
			<i>calmly, gently</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱλαρῶς καὶ εὐ. παρακελεύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Decent.</u>
					16
				</span></i>
			; later 
				contr.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐδεινός</span> (q.v.).</div>
